オーケストラ
[Song: Orchestra]

416
00:26:01,032 --> 00:26:05,632
あの時 君が付いた嘘
Back then, that lie you told—

417
00:26:05,632 --> 00:26:11,332
問い正せずに 泣いたあの坂道
unable to question it, I cried on that sloped road.

418
00:26:11,332 --> 00:26:15,932
この先 君と会えないの？
Will I never be able to see you again from now on?

419
00:26:15,932 --> 00:26:21,832
離れ離れに 身を任せてた
I simply surrendered to our drifting apart.

420
00:26:21,832 --> 00:26:27,732
いつもの後悔が 風に消えてく
My usual regrets fade away into the wind.

421
00:26:27,732 --> 00:26:32,732
誰にも見せない その姿を
That side of you that you show to no one else...

422
00:26:32,732 --> 00:26:38,232
